#. module: hosting_management
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hosting_management/wizards/base_partner_merge.py:0
msgid ""
"One of the contacts that would disappear, or one of its own contacts, "
"carries hosting services. Merging would move them to another client, "
"onto its status page and into its maintenance notices. Keep the record "
"that carries the services as the destination, or ask a hosting manager."
msgstr ""
"Une des fiches qui disparaîtraient, ou l'un de ses contacts, porte des "
"services d'hébergement. La fusion les déplacerait vers un autre client, "
"sur sa page d'état et dans ses avis de maintenance. Gardez comme "
"destination la fiche qui porte les services, ou demandez à un "
"gestionnaire d'hébergement."

#. module: hosting_management
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hosting_management/wizards/base_partner_merge.py:0
msgid ""
"The merge would attach the destination contact to another client, and it "
"carries hosting services, which would follow it onto that client's "
"status page and into its maintenance notices. Only a hosting manager can "
"merge it."
msgstr ""
"La fusion rattacherait la fiche de destination à un autre client, et "
"elle porte des services d'hébergement, qui la suivraient sur la page "
"d'état de ce client et dans ses avis de maintenance. Seul un "
"gestionnaire d'hébergement peut la fusionner."

#. module: hosting_management
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hosting_management/wizards/base_partner_merge.py:0
msgid ""
"The merge would make the destination a contact of one of its own "
"contacts. Unarchive the contacts concerned, or merge them in another "
"order."
msgstr ""
"La fusion ferait de la fiche de destination un contact de l'un de ses "
"propres contacts. Désarchivez les contacts concernés, ou fusionnez-les "
"dans un autre ordre."

#. module: hosting_management
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hosting_management/wizards/base_partner_merge.py:0
msgid ""
"Merging everything automatically would turn subsidiaries into plain "
"contacts of their parent company, and some of them carry hosting "
"services. Only a hosting manager can run it."
msgstr ""
"Tout fusionner automatiquement ferait des filiales de simples contacts "
"de leur société mère, et certaines portent des services d'hébergement. "
"Seul un gestionnaire d'hébergement peut le lancer."
